{"seq":1,"slug":"demand-response-and-flexibility","title":"需求响应与灵活性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/demand-response-and-flexibility","wordCount":2007,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"需求响应与灵活性\">需求响应与灵活性</h1><p>电网调度的第一直觉一直是「让发电跟着负荷走」：负荷涨了就多开机组，负荷降了就压出力。可当风光占比攀升、供给端本身变得不可控时，这条假设开始失效。需求响应（Demand Response, DR）把这套逻辑反转过来——让负荷跟着供给走：电多且便宜时多用，电少且紧张时少用或不用。国际能源署《Electricity 2026》指出，全球用电需求到本十年末年均增长超过 3.5%，是整体能源需求增速的两倍半，而高比例可变可再生能源（VRE）的接入要求电力系统灵活性大幅提升（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/flexibility\">IEA Electricity 2026 – Flexibility</a>）。需求响应正是这套灵活性工具箱里成本最低、见效最快的一项。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把需求响应放进「灵活性与电力市场」的语境，关键是看清三件事：它响应的是什么信号、它在哪个市场里被交易、它的响应时间尺度落在哪里。系统运行需要从毫秒级的频率调节到数小时的容量充裕度等多个时间尺度的灵活性，需求响应能横跨其中相当一段。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[系统灵活性需求] --&gt; B[供给侧灵活性&lt;br/&gt;燃气调峰/水电/储能]&#10;  A --&gt; C[需求侧灵活性&lt;br/&gt;需求响应 DR]&#10;  C --&gt; D[价格型 DR&lt;br/&gt;分时/实时/尖峰电价]&#10;  C --&gt; E[激励型 DR&lt;br/&gt;直接负荷控制/可中断/容量市场]&#10;  D --&gt; F[负荷自发平移]&#10;  E --&gt; G[聚合商调度&lt;br/&gt;VPP / DERMS]&#10;  F --&gt; H[市场出清: 能量/容量/辅助服务]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[削峰 / 填谷 / 调频 / 备用]\">flowchart TD\n  A[系统灵活性需求] --&gt; B[供给侧灵活性&lt;br/&gt;燃气调峰/水电/储能]\n  A --&gt; C[需求侧灵活性&lt;br/&gt;需求响应 DR]\n  C --&gt; D[价格型 DR&lt;br/&gt;分时/实时/尖峰电价]\n  C --&gt; E[激励型 DR&lt;br/&gt;直接负荷控制/可中断/容量市场]\n  D --&gt; F[负荷自发平移]\n  E --&gt; G[聚合商调度&lt;br/&gt;VPP / DERMS]\n  F --&gt; H[市场出清: 能量/容量/辅助服务]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[削峰 / 填谷 / 调频 / 备用]</pre><p>价格型 DR 把批发市场电价的波动直接传导给用户，让用户按不同时段的真实价值付费，常见形式有分时电价（ToU）、尖峰电价（CPP）、实时电价（RTP）等；激励型 DR 则向愿意削减或转移负荷的用户直接付费，包括直接负荷控制、可中断负荷、需求竞价、紧急需求响应、容量市场与各类辅助服务（<a href=\"https://www.enelnorthamerica.com/insights/blogs/types-of-demand-response-programs\">Enel North America: types of demand response</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>价格型 DR</th>\n<th>激励型 DR</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>触发信号</td>\n<td>电价（ToU/CPP/RTP）</td>\n<td>调度指令 + 合同支付</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用户参与方式</td>\n<td>自主响应价格</td>\n<td>事先签约、被调用时执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型时间尺度</td>\n<td>小时级</td>\n<td>分钟级（辅助服务）到小时级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收益形态</td>\n<td>省下的电费</td>\n<td>容量费 + 出清电价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可调度性</td>\n<td>弱（无法保证响应量）</td>\n<td>强（合同约定可削减量）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型场景</td>\n<td>居民/小商业错峰用电</td>\n<td>工业可中断、聚合电池调频</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"价格型-dr-与时间尺度的数学\">价格型 DR 与时间尺度的数学</h2><p>价格型 DR 的核心是用价格弹性撬动负荷。设某时段的电价为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、用户该时段的用电量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span>，自价格弹性定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>ε</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>q</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><mi>p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon = \\frac{\\partial q / q}{\\partial p / p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.363em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>居民负荷的短期价格弹性通常很小（绝对值常在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span> 之间），意味着单靠电价信号撬动的量有限——这正是为什么价格型 DR 多用于温和的常态错峰，而紧张时刻仍依赖激励型 DR 的强可调度性。</p>\n<p>跨时段的负荷平移则要看交叉价格弹性。若把尖峰时段记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>、低谷时段记为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span>，平移效应由 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∂</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{ij} = \\frac{\\partial q_i / q_i}{\\partial p_j / p_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5523em;vertical-align:-0.5423em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.01em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.485em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">∂</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5423em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span> 刻画。一个设计良好的分时电价，目标是让尖峰削减量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 尽量大，同时把这部分负荷搬到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ε</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varepsilon_{ij}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ε</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">ij</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为正的低谷时段，而非简单蒸发掉。</p>\n<p>辅助服务市场对时间尺度的要求截然不同。辅助服务里的 DR 指用户报价削减负荷形成的运行备用，一旦中标且被调用，按现货价格结算；其响应时间在分钟级，而削峰类 DR 通常是小时级响应（<a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S221067072400489X\">ScienceDirect: incentive vs price-based DR</a>）。这就解释了为什么空调、热水器、电池这类「可瞬时切除且用户几乎无感」的负荷，最适合进辅助服务，而非简单的电费优惠。</p>\n<h2 id=\"聚合-从单个负荷到虚拟电厂\">聚合：从单个负荷到虚拟电厂</h2><p>单个家庭的几千瓦削减对电网毫无意义，市场也无法直接和千万用户签约。聚合商（aggregator）把成千上万的分布式资源打包成一个可调度的整体——这就是虚拟电厂（VPP）。它对电网呈现为单一可调度资源，对内则靠 DERMS（分布式能源资源管理系统）逐个下发指令。</p>\n<p>VPP 在 2026 年已不是试点概念。加州在分布式灵活性上领先全球，截至 2026 年 3 月接入的 VPP 容量超过 42 GW，已从「仅限紧急」的需求响应走向把数万户家庭当作单一可调度资源的成熟市场模型；得州 ERCOT 的 ADER 试点同期支持约 160 MW（<a href=\"https://www.enverus.com/blog/the-virtual-power-plant-landscape-scaling-distributed-aggregation/\">Enverus: VPP landscape</a>，<a href=\"https://www.utilitydive.com/news/in-2026-virtual-power-plants-must-scale-or-risk-being-left-behind/810321/\">Utility Dive: VPPs must scale in 2026</a>）。加州的需求侧电网支持（DSGS）与紧急减载（ELRP）项目已通过 Sunrun、Tesla、Lunar Energy 等合作方聚合超过 9.5 万块电池；Tesla 借 Autobidder 软件在全球管理超过 3 GW 资产，并于 2026 年第一季度部署了 8.8 GWh 储能产品（<a href=\"https://www.enverus.com/blog/the-virtual-power-plant-landscape-scaling-distributed-aggregation/\">同上 Enverus 报告</a>）。</p>\n<p>聚合电池的削减量更可控，因此 VPP 的收益重心正从单纯的削峰转向高价值的辅助服务与容量市场——这与前一节「分钟级响应进辅助服务」的逻辑一致。</p>\n<h2 id=\"市场准入-ferc-order-2222-与监管摩擦\">市场准入：FERC Order 2222 与监管摩擦</h2><p>技术能聚合，不等于市场允许它进场。美国的关键里程碑是 FERC 第 2222 号令，它要求各区域电力市场（RTO/ISO）开放规则，让分布式能源资源的聚合体以与传统机组同等的身份参与批发市场（<a href=\"https://www.ferc.gov/media/ferc-order-no-2222-fact-sheet\">FERC Order No. 2222 Fact Sheet</a>）。但落地节奏因区域而异，且仍有反复。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[FERC Order 2222&lt;br/&gt;开放 DER 聚合参与批发市场] --&gt; B[NYISO&lt;br/&gt;目标 2026 年底全面实施]&#10;  A --&gt; C[ISO-NE&lt;br/&gt;容量市场 2027-02-01]&#10;  A --&gt; D[MISO&lt;br/&gt;Phase 1 2027-06-01&lt;br/&gt;Phase 2 2029-06-01]&#10;  A --&gt; E[PJM&lt;br/&gt;2026 持续更新聚合工具]&#10;  D --&gt; F[2026-01 FERC 否决&lt;br/&gt;MISO 过渡模型]&#10;  E --&gt; G[各州推进&lt;br/&gt;互联改革 / VPP 试点]\">graph TD\n  A[FERC Order 2222&lt;br/&gt;开放 DER 聚合参与批发市场] --&gt; B[NYISO&lt;br/&gt;目标 2026 年底全面实施]\n  A --&gt; C[ISO-NE&lt;br/&gt;容量市场 2027-02-01]\n  A --&gt; D[MISO&lt;br/&gt;Phase 1 2027-06-01&lt;br/&gt;Phase 2 2029-06-01]\n  A --&gt; E[PJM&lt;br/&gt;2026 持续更新聚合工具]\n  D --&gt; F[2026-01 FERC 否决&lt;br/&gt;MISO 过渡模型]\n  E --&gt; G[各州推进&lt;br/&gt;互联改革 / VPP 试点]</pre><p>具体看：NYISO 目标在 2026 年底前全面实施；ISO-NE 的容量市场实施时间为 2027 年 2 月 1 日；MISO 的 Phase 1 计划 2027 年 6 月 1 日完成、Phase 2 到 2029 年 6 月 1 日。而 2026 年 1 月，FERC 否决了 MISO 那套本想在 2026/27 年提前实施的过渡模型（<a href=\"https://www.renewableenergyworld.com/solar/ferc-rejects-misos-demand-response-model-for-order-2222-2/\">Renewable Energy World: FERC rejects MISO model</a>，<a href=\"https://www.utilitydive.com/news/in-2026-virtual-power-plants-must-scale-or-risk-being-left-behind/810321/\">Utility Dive: Order 2222 in 2026</a>）。这种「政策定方向、落地拖数年」的张力，是当下灵活性市场最现实的瓶颈——技术成熟度往往跑在市场规则前面。</p>\n<p>英国的路径略有不同：从 2026 年春季起，以消费者为主导的灵活性（consumer-led flexibility）将能参与更广范围的市场和服务，用户因在特定时段减少用电而获得收益（<a href=\"https://www.energy-uk.org.uk/publications/energy-uk-explains-how-consumer-led-flexibility-works-in-power-markets/\">Energy UK: consumer-led flexibility</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新变量-数据中心与可控大负荷\">新变量：数据中心与可控大负荷</h2><p>需求响应过去主要盯着「把不可控的小负荷聚合起来」，2026 年出现了相反的机会：AI 数据中心这类巨型、且天然可调度的单点负荷。IEA 强调，用电激增叠加电气化（供暖、交通）使 DR 的价值水涨船高——规模化部署的 DR 能削减峰值容量需求、推迟电网投资、降低可再生能源的整合成本，并在系统紧张时增强韧性（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/energy-system/energy-efficiency-and-demand/demand-response\">IEA: demand response</a>）。</p>\n<p>数据中心的特殊性在于：它本身有不间断电源和电池，训练类负荷可在分钟级内削减或转移，等于一个现成的工业级 VPP 节点。这让「大负荷主动配合电网」从理念变成商业谈判桌上的真实选项，也促使监管者重新审视大负荷接入对小型公用事业豁免资格等规则的冲击（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/grids\">IEA Electricity 2026 – Grids</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>需求响应把「发电跟着负荷走」反转为「负荷跟着供给走」，是灵活性工具箱里成本最低、见效最快的一项（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/flexibility\">IEA Electricity 2026 – Flexibility</a>）。</li>\n<li>价格型 DR 靠价格弹性温和错峰，但居民短期弹性小（约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span></span></span></span></span>）；激励型 DR 凭合同保证可调度量，分钟级响应可进辅助服务市场。</li>\n<li>聚合（VPP/DERMS）把海量小资源变成单一可调度资源；加州 2026 年 3 月接入 VPP 容量超 42 GW，得州 ADER 约 160 MW（<a href=\"https://www.enverus.com/blog/the-virtual-power-plant-landscape-scaling-distributed-aggregation/\">Enverus</a>）。</li>\n<li>市场准入是真正瓶颈：FERC Order 2222 落地节奏区域各异、2026 年 1 月还否决了 MISO 过渡模型（<a href=\"https://www.renewableenergyworld.com/solar/ferc-rejects-misos-demand-response-model-for-order-2222-2/\">Renewable Energy World</a>）。</li>\n<li>AI 数据中心等可控大负荷正成为新的灵活性来源，把「大负荷配合电网」推上商业谈判桌（<a href=\"https://www.iea.org/reports/electricity-2026/grids\">IEA Electricity 2026 – Grids</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"需求响应与灵活性","id":"需求响应与灵活性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"价格型 DR 与时间尺度的数学","id":"价格型-dr-与时间尺度的数学"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合：从单个负荷到虚拟电厂","id":"聚合-从单个负荷到虚拟电厂"},{"level":2,"text":"市场准入：FERC Order 2222 与监管摩擦","id":"市场准入-ferc-order-2222-与监管摩擦"},{"level":2,"text":"新变量：数据中心与可控大负荷","id":"新变量-数据中心与可控大负荷"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"功率预测与弃电","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/renewable-integration/forecasting-and-curtailment"},"next":{"title":"虚拟电厂","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/power-grid-and-energy-storage/flexibility-and-markets/virtual-power-plants"}}